---
/** Hero.astro — scaled-down elegant hero */
---

<section class="relative min-h-[80vh] flex items-center justify-center px-5 pt-16 pb-8 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2
                w-[480px] h-[480px] sm:w-[560px] sm:h-[560px] rounded-full
                bg-gradient-to-r from-accent/10 via-purple-500/5 to-pink-500/5 blur-3xl"
         style="animation: pulse-glow 4s ease-in-out infinite;"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4
                w-[300px] h-[300px] sm:w-[360px] sm:h-[360px] rounded-full
                bg-accent/[0.04] blur-3xl animate-float"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.025]"
         style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, var(--color-text) 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl animate-hero relative">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-6 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full
                bg-accent/5 border border-accent/[0.12] text-accent/70 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium
                animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse"></span>
      Welcome to LoveYX
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl
               font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.08]
               animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay:0.2s">
      <span style="color: var(--color-text)">Build Something</span><br/>
      <span class="text-gradient">Interesting.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 sm:mt-8 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed animate-fade-up
              max-w-md mx-auto"
       style="color: var(--color-muted); animation-delay:0.4s;">
      探索技术前沿，记录创造历程。<br class="hidden sm:block"/>
      在代码与文字之间，发现无限可能。
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 animate-fade-up"
         style="animation-delay:0.6s">
      <a href="/blog"
         class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm text-white
                shadow-lg shadow-accent/15
                transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5
                active:translate-y-0 active:scale-[0.98] hover:no-underline"
         style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent), #6366f1);">
        查看博客
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/about"
         class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3 rounded-xl font-medium text-sm
                border transition-all duration-300
                hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md active:translate-y-0 active:scale-[0.98] hover:no-underline"
         style="color: var(--color-muted); border-color: var(--color-border);">
        了解更多
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex items-center justify-center gap-6 sm:gap-10 animate-fade-up"
         style="animation-delay:0.8s">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text)">技术</div>
        <div class="text-xs mt-1" style="color: var(--color-muted)">深度文章</div>
      </div>
      <div class="w-px h-8 sm:h-10 bg-[var(--color-border)]"></div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text)">AI</div>
        <div class="text-xs mt-1" style="color: var(--color-muted)">前沿探索</div>
      </div>
      <div class="w-px h-8 sm:h-10 bg-[var(--color-border)]"></div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text)">生活</div>
        <div class="text-xs mt-1" style="color: var(--color-muted)">思考记录</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-24 -z-10"
       style="background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--color-bg), transparent);"></div>
</section>
